            "review_title": "Review at Papa's Chicken",
            "review_text": "SaigonExile\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nHuge Portions, Huge Taste!\nApr 2023\nOne of our favourite Korean chicken places had closed so we went to Papa's for the first time. I must say, we were are quite satisfied. We got the Sweet & Sour boneless, half-chicken, and the Spicy boneless and some other knick knacks for the kids. \n\nThe portions were huge! The chicken was spot on taste wise. I must say, we will go back again. \n\nIt was a satisfying evening for all and we recommend Papa's for anyone who love Korean fried chicken as much as we do.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 13, 2023",
