            "review_text": "Nguyễn T\n27 contributions\n0\nPapas'chicken - Korean Food Style. 346 Trường Sa, 2 Ward, Phú Nhuận District, Ho Chi Minh City\nDec 2016 • Friends\nPapas'chicken - Korean Food Style. 346 Trường Sa, 2 Ward, Phú Nhuận District, Ho Chi Minh City\nOne day, I wondering how the feeling when confuse between chicken and cheese. And the discover journey started : )))\nPapas's chicken is one of the famous fast food branding in Ho Chi Minh City. I think restaurant's style was confused between Italian and Korean. You will feeling cheese smells faintly and cute arranging of Korean - clean and cute.\nServices is OK - polite.\n//-------------------------------------------//\nI tried two kind inside the menu - I posted at attached file - the reference price - one is chicken cheese and the second was chicken sauce garlic.\n//-------------------------------------------//\nChicken cheese is so good. I like this baked cheese. You will feeling toughness, fatty and salty moderate. Chicken was marinated quite sweet but I like it. The sauce garlic is too sweet. Yeah, I think just suit for kid. But chicked was very crispy fried.\nDrink is ok. There is fruit juice which packaged by glass botte - very professional. There are orange, grape, apple, ... and others.\n//-------------------------------------------//\n* The total damage is: 370, 000 VND with 2 dish of chicken. My grape fruit juice and my old man friend's Pepsi. Two wet handkerchief, top side: cabbage + carrot + turnip.\n//-------------------------------------------//\nThat's all. Summary, Papas's Chicken suit for couple, fast food and relax. The background outside also is not bad. I will back in future. Sure! : )\nThank you for your track.\nRobert NGUYEN - Saigon cuisine.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten December 22, 2016",
